# Record the README GIF with https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs : vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "nanny demo" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Down Sleep 600ms Down Sleep 600ms Enter Sleep 2s Escape
Type "2" Sleep 1s Type "/redis" Sleep 1.5s Escape Escape
Type "3" Sleep 1.5s
Type "4" Sleep 1.5s
Ctrl+K Type "new infra" Sleep 1.5s Escape
Type "?" Sleep 2s Escape
Sleep 1s
